<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 68.9619 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 68.9619 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 68.9619 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.8970 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 18		  Sep 17</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     68.9619		 68.8970</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  1.150		   2.695</p>
<p>				    Sep 18		  Sep 16</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.7350		 45.6200</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.010		   0.020</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
